00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:28.860
moves the Optimus program one step closer to the cost per unit clarity investors are seeking

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:36.320
before external sales can begin. Elon Musk described Optimus as potentially Tesla's largest product.

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:42.340
He outlined three remaining hurdles before volume production. The statement aligns with earlier

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:49.960
targets of 2027 for initial external sales. Observers will watch for updates on those specific technical

