00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:57.460
Regulators rarely move quickly on vehicle safety standards until a pattern of incidents forces

00:10:57.460 --> 00:11:03.600
their hand. The current effort to draft new door requirements after Tesla-related fatalities

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:09.700
