00:11:10.360 --> 00:11:14.620
Once the standard is set, the cost of compliance spreads across the industry,

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:20.380
but the first company to adapt its hardware and software carries the initial engineering burden

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:27.080
and any early liability exposure. That burden lands first on Tesla because its automatic door

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:33.480
